{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/2czvfi47zvy48kayf38eg3g8ycxlit7.mp3","text":"没发现我在你身后？那当然啊～我可是猫，怎么会有脚步声呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/sdd3400zhfr731d2d05c48rzpnxq9ge.mp3","text":"我的帽子，你可别乱动~它已经疯掉了，要是不小心说出太多秘密给你听到，那对博士可是没好处的哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/ghhnoptmbxxyq9bz5pk9uzc59qbaw6y.mp3","text":"没想到罗德岛连越狱犯都敢接收？是想看看我身上的地图吗？还是想了解了解越狱的办法？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/ll59jbnfmbq62wnwg320ga5duiw139b.mp3","text":"“盗亦有道”——窃贼也有自己的规则哦，说不定是这样的吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/p0d9wu6yaraio3q7nwmxemtnvahlouy.mp3","text":"呜喵？不用在意哦，是我的自言自语而已~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/tp4h4iwbbwkmbokak03vrusjubimk1t.mp3","text":"出发吧，别担心，凡是我朋友走过的地方，都有我的眼线。","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/gpbd4zen2ado84nsqxwi4326k4df2q5.mp3","text":"好奇心可是会害死猫的哟~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/0jdp8dkz4fxbdmi2kggkzgmiad7p76d.mp3","text":"我现在，心情很好，来给你个谜语猜猜吧~『为什么乌鸦长得像写字台？』呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/07wnrgf8gs6lm3vxdb6srjgwkj6q8be.mp3","text":"多谢你给我新的身份，但是啊......你是不是看到了？看到了啊，一些本该只属于我自己的秘密？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/9pg7p2d0w2jqv7p7evjozxkdc5nqwm3.mp3","text":"......既然这家伙也睡了，那就差不多——该开始“干活”了喵~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/fal2agyt6h7vaoz9hyxxny0kyf5lo53.mp3","text":"你好~叫我夜烟~我喜欢轻轻松松的工作环境，和一个不会向我问这问那的雇主~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/s4gz32jo6o385fvycadigfh8riab2k8.mp3","text":"好吃~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/qv46lq0ehv93dn6x706nm3ri4rbqmpc.mp3","text":"晋升？那是什么？很好吃吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/swf7gig7i3u1ds7h78uzx2uc05jr3ru.mp3","text":"总算是挣脱了旧的枷锁，却很快又被装上了新的。这也许就是窃贼的宿命吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/c8jnxdtsr533s2apl1ncq4rq0vi0itk.mp3","text":"让我自由一点儿就行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/1b2it7st2t6q4f9d90nxnv5xy1urouy.mp3","text":"干嘛还要有队长，自由作战不好嘛？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/sqw3h4er006t0rl87moxd5asck3rj4m.mp3","text":"呜喵......这是令我狂喜的，自由的味道！","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/94lipjnkfv6mafrm3czv750kxtowe6o.mp3","text":"大家可以自由作战哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/8gde9zloa6iotvmdkvnef3gd7m48gg1.mp3","text":"喵呼？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/qgl0cu83gwigshtxfacym5kj6ttr5kf.mp3","text":"要上了哟——","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/5y7pcjc8jg9mbd74qf590hrk8p4uvx4.mp3","text":"来了来了~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/6v78w0xc7yocu4jc7gkck2wxtkurk3l.mp3","text":"像影子一样~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/kegec4dlvxkdswc6pakkqxlswd7suxd.mp3","text":"这个怎么样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/fy1x73gbvvxr36xmigg66j766kd03ko.mp3","text":"太大意可不行哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/k2lo8laakts5cbo04ezhl6xv81aen13.mp3","text":"你觉得自己很强对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/k2bql2wz23hsqldd2yj6nd9b1utamq9.mp3","text":"别太自信哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/srb7k1n9r7d0wjr1b3gn3jmu9nj46gz.mp3","text":"永远不允许有什么在猫头上称王称霸~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/e50f85e8xnd13oxs6hfos73n16thjy3.mp3","text":"完美胜利？无所谓啦~能赢就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/5cwjywgxzl0wu2cvl7sw0knu7lx7ynk.mp3","text":"你知道你放走了多少敌人嘛？这样可不行啊~","alt":"voice_cn/char_141_nights/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/2uir5bm0u7ojnljhnibg21xy5ez6s0p.mp3",